# --- AI coding assistants ----------------------------------------------------
# Local tool state, not project source. These hold absolute paths to whoever's
# machine ran the tool - drive letters, home directories, download folders - so
# they are personal even when they look like config, and they conflict on every
# pull when two people work the same repo.
#
# .claude/settings.json was tracked until now and carried O:\GIT\jmfsb paths; it
# has been removed from the index (the file is still on disk).

# Anthropic - Claude Code
# .claude/
# .claude.json
# CLAUDE.local.md
# CLAUDE.md
# **/CLAUDE.md

# Agent instruction files, kept out of the repo by choice - they are working
# notes for whoever is driving the tool, not project source.
# AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
# GEMINI.md
# **/GEMINI.md

# Model Context Protocol server definitions (often carry tokens/paths)
.mcp.json

# Cursor
# .cursor/
# .cursorrules
# .cursorignore
# .cursorindexingignore

# # GitHub Copilot (workspace-local state)
# .copilot/

# Aider
.aider*

